  "description": "\"Swear loyalty to me. Comfort me.\"\n\nAfter her brother's death, Countess Selene is driven to the edge of a precipice.   \nTo protect her family, she attempts to seduce and win over Aiden, the only knight she could trust.   \nBecause she believed he was a naive, loyal knight of common birth.   \nBecause she foolishly thought she could keep him under her absolute control.   \nHowever, that was Selene's arrogance.\n\n\"How would you like me to comfort you, my young lord?\"\n\nFeigning falling for her clumsy seduction, Aiden reveals his beastly true nature.    \nHe snaps the leash Selene was holding and turns the tables, tightening a chokehold around her breath.\n\nA beastly predator by night, a flawless knight by day.  \nThe secret and sultry circumstances of a knight set out to devour his lord's body, mind, and territory.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002607)",
